osiris-desktop-theme (0.2.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Material Symbols Rounded 300 icon family for VS Code and GNOME/XDG.
  * Restore the VS Code product icon theme and bundle its generated WOFF.
  * Match the current VS Code 2/4/6/8/12 px corner-radius hierarchy.

