  * Transition to Papirus Icon Theme (Papirus-Dark, Papirus, breeze, gnome, hicolor).
  * Unified minimal border radius (2px) across GTK 3, GTK 4, and GNOME Shell.

 -- Richard Bláha <richardblaha@gmail.com>  Wed, 09 Sep 2026 18:00:00 +0000

osiris-desktop-theme (0.1.1-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Bundled Fira Code (SIL OFL-1.1) webfont under assets/fonts/fira-code/; the
    GRUB .pf2 build now sources the Fira Code TTF from the system or the pinned
    upstream release instead of silently falling back to unicode.pf2.
  * Application icon set (.ico / .icns / multi-resolution .png + freedesktop
    hicolor tree) under assets/icons/app/, generated by
    scripts/lib/gen_appicons.py.
  * Letterpress OSIRIS watermark marks + 1x/2x rasters (assets/watermarks/).

 -- Richard Bláha <richardblaha@gmail.com>  Fri, 04 Sep 2026 12:00:00 +0000

osiris-desktop-theme (0.1.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial packaging.
    - osiris-theme-gtk: GTK 3/4 + libadwaita + GNOME Shell (Osiris / Osiris-Light)
    - osiris-theme-plasma: Plasma color schemes, Kvantum, Aurorae, desktop theme
    - osiris-theme-grub: graphical GRUB2 boot theme + post-install wiring
    - osiris-wallpapers: Abstract Bloom + Ancient Egypt Sci-Fi, static + dynamic
    - osiris-desktop-theme: metapackage

